  "scope": "Focused protocol backports only: keep inline system turns for official 1017 encoder; preserve tool-result image/call-ID binding; default omitted Responses image detail to auto. No renderer/encoder/kernel/usage-counter replacement. Offline guard additionally accepts strict-base64 PNG/JPEG signatures under Codex application/octet-stream; arbitrary binary and all remote/file URLs remain denied. Guard does not misclassify tool-use business input or JSON-schema parameter/example objects as media; actual tool-result/Responses image payloads remain validated. V4 adds OpenAI/Codex reasoning effort aliases on the native 1-100 scale (minimal=25, medium=63, xhigh=90), preserves native low/high/max and explicit thinking-off, and forwards validated Claude enabled-thinking token budgets to the native sampler. No encoder, GPU kernel, serving configuration or usage accounting replacement.",
